<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Android 性能测试报告</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 1100px; color: #222; line-height: 1.6; }
  h1 { border-bottom: 2px solid #333; padding-bottom: .3rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; border-left: 4px solid #2a7; padding-left: .6rem; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1rem 0; font-size: .92rem; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: .35rem .5rem; text-align: right; }
  th { background: #f4f4f4; }
  td:first-child, th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  .meta { color: #555; font-size: .9rem; background: #f9f9f9; padding: .6rem .8rem; border-radius: 4px; }
  .diff-pos { color: #c33; font-weight: 600; }   /* 变差（如 jank↑、耗时↑）红 */
  .diff-neg { color: #2a7; font-weight: 600; }   /* 变好 绿 */
  img { max-width: 100%; margin: .5rem 0; border: 1px solid #eee; }
  .footer { margin-top: 2rem; color: #888; font-size: .8rem; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: .6rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Android 性能测试报告</h1>
<div class="meta">
  <strong>设备</strong>: {{ device.model }} ({{ device.brand }}) · Android {{ device.android_version }} (SDK {{ device.sdk }}) · {{ device.abi }}<br>
  <strong>Root</strong>: {{ device.root_status }} · <strong>Trace 后端</strong>: {{ device.trace_backend }} · <strong>FrameTimeline</strong>: {{ device.frame_timeline }}<br>
  <strong>生成时间</strong>: {{ generated_at }}
</div>

{% for bench in benchmarks %}
<h2>{{ bench.title }}</h2>
{% if bench.rows %}
<table>
  <thead><tr>{% for h in bench.columns %}<th>{{ h }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for row in bench.rows %}
  <tr>{% for h in bench.columns %}<td>{{ row[h] }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% endif %}
{% if bench.summary %}<p><strong>汇总</strong>: {{ bench.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
{% if bench.image %}<img src="{{ bench.image }}" alt="{{ bench.title }}">{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<div class="footer">
  本报告由 android-perf-bench 生成，测量方法学复刻自 Fleet (ASPLOS'24)。
  startup: am start -W + android_startup (TTID/TTFD) · jank: Choreographer#doFrame 16.7ms + FrameTimeline · cache: dumpsys meminfo。
</div>
</body>
</html>
